<title>SRI LANKA: TABLE-S.Lanka Agalawatte H1 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S.Lanka Agalawatte H1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	     49.82    vs     42.69</p>
<p>    Turnover		337.45    vs    298.83</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. Agalawatte Plantations is one of six privatised estate firms trading in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
